# Claude #2b: THE CLIMBERS. A queue of n cards numbered 1..n (all different). Each turn the front card with
# number v slides back to place v (so card 1 stays in front... no: card v goes behind v-1 others) and then
# its number goes up by one (n wraps to 1). Loop length by echo.
use stdlib
: n 600 dig ;
: a 1000 + dig ;
: put 1000 + bury ;
: step 1 a dup n % 1 + 820 bury n min 821 bury 821 dig 1 > if 1 [ dup 1 + a over put 1 + dup 821 dig = if drop 0 then ] drop then 820 dig 821 dig put ;
: look 1001 1000 n + echo ;
: deal 1 [ dup over put 1 + dup n > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: CAP 602 dig ;
: run look drop 0 501 bury 1 [ drop step 501 dig 1 + 501 bury look dup 500 bury 0 = 501 dig CAP > 0 = * ] drop 500 dig ;
